    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_stake",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "A community policy can look efficient on paper while overlooking stakeholders who have less capacity to participate in consultation."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "سیاست محلی می‌تونه روی کاغذ کارا باشه ولی ذی‌نفع‌هایی رو نادیده بگیره که ظرفیت کمتری برای شرکت در مشورت دارن."
        },
        "intent": "identify_participation_gap",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_stakeholder",
          "c1_community_policy_consultation",
          "c1_community_policy_capacity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_access",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The issue is not only whether the service exists, but whether people can access it at the times and locations they actually need."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مسئله فقط وجود سرویس نیست؛ اینه که مردم در زمان و مکان موردنیاز واقعاً بهش دسترسی دارن یا نه."
        },
        "intent": "define_access",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_access",
          "c1_community_policy_impact"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_allocation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Resource allocation inevitably reflects priorities, so the criteria should be visible and open to challenge."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "تخصیص منابع ناگزیر اولویت‌ها رو بازتاب می‌ده، پس معیارها باید قابل مشاهده و قابل اعتراض باشن."
        },
        "intent": "question_allocation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_allocation",
          "c1_community_policy_proposal"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_equity",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Equal provision is not always equitable if some neighborhoods face substantially greater barriers."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "ارائه برابر همیشه عادلانه نیست اگر بعضی محله‌ها موانع خیلی بیشتری داشته باشن."
        },
        "intent": "distinguish_equality_equity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_equity",
          "c1_community_policy_access"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_consult",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A consultation process should explain how public input affected the final proposal, not merely record that comments were collected."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "روند مشورت باید بگه نظر مردم چطور روی پیشنهاد نهایی اثر گذاشت، نه اینکه فقط ثبت کنه نظرها جمع شدن."
        },
        "intent": "evaluate_consultation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_consultation",
          "c1_community_policy_proposal"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_capacity",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The council may lack capacity to implement every request, but that constraint should be stated before priorities are ranked."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "شورا شاید ظرفیت اجرای همه درخواست‌ها رو نداشته باشه، ولی این محدودیت باید قبل از رتبه‌بندی اولویت‌ها صریح بشه."
        },
        "intent": "surface_capacity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_capacity",
          "c1_community_policy_allocation"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_impact",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would assess impact by who gains access, who loses convenience, and whether any group carries a disproportionate burden."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اثر رو بر اساس اینکه چه کسی دسترسی می‌گیره، چه کسی راحتی از دست می‌ده و آیا گروهی بار نامتناسب تحمل می‌کنه می‌سنجم."
        },
        "intent": "assess_policy_impact",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_impact",
          "c1_community_policy_equity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_community_policy_close",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A legitimate local decision does not require unanimous agreement, but it should make the trade-offs and reasoning understandable."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "تصمیم محلی معتبر نیاز به توافق همه نداره، ولی باید بده‌بستان‌ها و منطقش قابل فهم باشه."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_legitimacy",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_community_policy_proposal",
          "c1_community_policy_stakeholder"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_community_policy_nominalisation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-01",
        "slug": "c1-community-policy-nominalisation",
        "title": "Nominalisation in formal discourse",
        "rule_summary": "Turn verbs or adjectives into noun phrases to make formal arguments more compact and abstract when appropriate.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در گفتار و نوشتار رسمی، در صورت مناسب بودن فعل یا صفت را به عبارت اسمی تبدیل می‌کنیم تا استدلال فشرده‌تر و انتزاعی‌تر شود."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The rapid expansion of the service created new risks.",
            "fa": "گسترش سریع سرویس ریسک‌های جدیدی ایجاد کرد."
          },
          {
            "en": "A reduction in waiting times would benefit everyone.",
            "fa": "کاهش زمان انتظار به نفع همه خواهد بود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_community_policy_concession_rebuttal",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-02",
        "slug": "c1-community-policy-concession-rebuttal",
        "title": "Concession followed by rebuttal",
        "rule_summary": "Acknowledge a reasonable opposing point before limiting it or presenting a stronger counterargument.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "ابتدا یک نکته منطقی از طرف مقابل را می‌پذیریم و سپس دامنه آن را محدود می‌کنیم یا پاسخ قوی‌تری می‌دهیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Granted, the process is faster; that does not necessarily make it fairer.",
            "fa": "درست است که روند سریع‌تر است؛ اما لزوماً عادلانه‌تر نیست."
          },
          {
            "en": "While that concern is valid, it overlooks the cost of doing nothing.",
            "fa": "با اینکه آن نگرانی معتبر است، هزینه هیچ کاری نکردن را نادیده می‌گیرد."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_community_policy_formal_subjunctive",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-03",
        "slug": "c1-community-policy-formal-subjunctive",
        "title": "Formal mandative structures",
        "rule_summary": "In formal recommendations and requirements, use structures such as it is essential that ... be and they recommended that ... be.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در توصیه‌ها و الزامات رسمی می‌توان از ساختارهایی مثل it is essential that ... be و they recommended that ... be استفاده کرد."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "It is essential that every applicant be given the same information.",
            "fa": "ضروری است به هر متقاضی اطلاعات یکسان داده شود."
          },
          {
            "en": "The committee recommended that the proposal be revised.",
            "fa": "کمیته توصیه کرد پیشنهاد بازبینی شود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_community_policy_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-community-policy-01",
        "title": "Community Policy: part 1",
        "setting": "seminar break",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Ella",
          "Amir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "Which assumption is doing most of the work here?",
            "translation_fa": "کدوم فرض بیشترین نقش رو در این استدلال داره؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "A community policy can look efficient on paper while overlooking stakeholders who have less capacity to participate in consultation.",
            "translation_fa": "سیاست محلی می‌تونه روی کاغذ کارا باشه ولی ذی‌نفع‌هایی رو نادیده بگیره که ظرفیت کمتری برای شرکت در مشورت دارن."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ella",
            "text": "How would the conclusion change if that assumption failed?",
            "translation_fa": "اگر اون فرض برقرار نباشه نتیجه چطور عوض می‌شه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Amir",
            "text": "The issue is not only whether the service exists, but whether people can access it at the times and locations they actually need.",
